ns certaines gares.<br><br>Les &#233;quipes ont travaill&#233; sans rel&#226;che pour pouvoir remettre en circulation les trains de l'axe Les Mureaux depuis le lundi 14 septembre et restent mobilis&#233;es pour un retour &#224; la normale au cours de l'automne pour l'axe Conflans-Sainte-Honorine.<br><br>Retrouvez chaque vendredi d&#232;s 17h les horaires des trains qui circuleront la semaine suivante sur la rubrique \"Recherche Itin&#233;raire\". Nous vous recommandons &#233;galement de v&#233;rifier vos horaires avant de vous rendre en gare.<br><br>Pour plus d&#8217;informations rendez vous sur <a href=\"https:\/\/malignej.transilien.com\/\">le Blog<br>Ligne J<\/a><\/p>","shortMessage":"Trafic fortement perturbé","disruption_id":"5bb9f35e-f229-4bc3-a594-dd68beb92774"},{"id":"e79f7fff-2c35-4afa-82a8-fdc03b6e85c4","applicationPeriods":[{"begin":"20260629T161600","end":"20281231T200000"}],"lastUpdate":"20260831T153045","cause":"PERTURBATION","severity":"PERTURBEE","title":"Travaux","message":"<p>L'arrêt Capitaine Glarner est non desservi<\/p>"}],"lines":[{"id":"line:IDFM:C01371","name":"1","shortName":"1","mode":"Metro","networkId":"network:IDFM:Operator_100","impactedObjects":[{"type":"stop_point","id":"stop_point:IDFM:463150","name":"Concorde","disruptionIds":["a90d5f47-90a4-47af-9b75-ad93e541d7ba"]}]},{"id":"line:IDFM:C01372","name":"2","shortName":"2","mode":"Metro","networkId":"network:IDFM:Operator_100","impactedObjects":[{"type":"line","id":"line:IDFM:C01372","name":"2","disruptionIds":["e58642a4-fb33-4766-8d07-3cf7a1c9ea19"]}]},{"id":"line:IDFM:C01373","name":"3","shortName":"3","mode":"Metro","networkId":"network:IDFM:Operator_100","impactedObjects":[{"type":"stop_point","id":"stop_point:IDFM:22026","name":"Temple","disruptionIds":["3643db48-f435-4eae-b5b1-8fbd2f61f7ee"]},{"type":"stop_point","id":"stop_point:IDFM:22035","name":"Pont de Levallois - Bécon","disruptionIds":["7609b2a6-e0bd-4dc3-a915-556b1dfa37a3"]}]},{"id":"line:IDFM:C01374","name":"4","shortNam